nuubOS SFTP integration package

This local package contains no third-party source code. It depends on the
Buildroot OpenSSH package and installs only the built sftp-server subsystem
helper at /usr/libexec/sftp-server for use by Dropbear.

The OpenSSH binary retains its upstream licensing/provenance through the
Buildroot OpenSSH package metadata. Dropbear remains the sole SSH daemon.
